# Yogurt Bowl Recipe
## Ingredients

1 cup (240g) plain yogurt (Greek yogurt recommended)
1/2 cup (50g) granola
1/2 cup (75g) fresh fruits (e.g., strawberries, blueberries, banana slices)
1 tablespoon honey or maple syrup
1 tablespoon nuts (e.g., almonds, walnuts), chopped
1 teaspoon chia seeds or flax seeds (optional)
A few mint leaves for garnish (optional)

## Instructions
Prepare the Base:

Spoon the yogurt into a bowl and spread it evenly as the base.

Add the Toppings:

Arrange the fresh fruits on top of the yogurt. Add granola and chopped nuts evenly over the bowl.

Sweeten the Bowl:

Drizzle honey or maple syrup over the ingredients for added sweetness.

Add Extras (Optional):

Sprinkle chia seeds or flax seeds on top for extra nutrition.

Serve:

Garnish with mint leaves if desired. Serve immediately and enjoy your fresh yogurt bowl.
